# Verify the Observational Session Search Finish Line

## Step

Run the agreed real-query comparison and failure drills against production-shaped data. Joel verifies that reflections answer first, observations support them, evidence is one explicit step away, project boundaries hold, raw transcript sludge stays out of default results, schema/version errors teach rather than disappear, and a clean rebuild returns the same projection. Close the effort only when maintenance receipts also prove Stop freshness, SessionEnd finalization, and twice-daily repair recovery.
